oth"},{"type":"note","text":"These two are probably Elm too (no name is shown):","id":"61-7-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The Master Ball is the best!\n\nIt’s the ultimate Poké Ball! It’ll catch\nany Pokémon without fail.\n\nIt’s given only to noted\nPokémon researchers.\n\nI think you can make much better\nuse of it than I can, [Player]!","id":"61-7-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"By the way...\n\nWe just had a group of beautiful\nKimono Girls looking for you.","id":"61-7-0-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Your friend steps up to you, then walks out. Boy and girl players hear the same words except the name (Lyra for a boy player, Ethan for a girl player, probably).","id":"61-7-0-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player], people are talking\nabout you!\n\nI heard you helped Kimono Girls?\n\nYou’ve been helping all these people!\nYou make me proud to be your friend.","id":"61-7-0-block-10","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"Elm ends the scene with his Kimono Girls line (\"The Kimono Girls are waiting for you at the Ecruteak Dance Theater.\", under \"Professor Elm\" below).","id":"61-7-0-block-11","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Lyra\"","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=8","source":"843 S#15; 543 m58"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Ethan\"","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=8","source":"843 S#15; 543 m59"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15b","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=8","source":"843 S#15; 543 m60"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15g","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=8","source":"843 S#15; 543 m61"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15c","type":"Dialogue variant